# --- Secrets and personal settings: never commit these ----------------------
# .env holds the Anthropic key, Gmail app password and Instagram password.
# config.yaml holds your Gmail address, burner handle and server token.
# Commit the *.example versions instead.
.env
config.yaml
ig_session.json
*.keystore
*.jks

